{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"as he approached the colored glazed statues \"This is Amara and Navar.... the two best people I know... they were the ones that welcomed me into the colonists as family.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:12:18.798000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739999120298737765","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
