{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"Lilia runs her hand along the base of thd statue of Navar \"They died on their journey here? I recognize her from the shade of Sir Rigatony's blade.\" She says looking at the statue of Amara","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:15:43.261000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"739999977878847581","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"yes.... they were... dedicated... to risking everything for a glimmer of a chance of bringing back the dead gods.... they failed\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:16:32.672000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740000185123471422","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"he called himself a living shield.... one of the kindest and gentlest souls I have met.... she... she was for more kind and patient..... both stubborn.... I loved each one\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:17:45.125000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740000489013510176","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"I see.\"  She looks at the two statues for a moment then turns back to Sandigill.  \"It's wonderful that you are keeping their memory.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:18:33.206000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740000690679840802","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"nod \"thank you.... I needed someone to understand.... everyone is so... complicated.... \" motions to the water \"I put white water lillys in the water in her honor.... it was the gift I gave her.... sadly I cannot tattoo... so i cannot get the tattoo for him\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:20:59.883000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740001305887637617","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"Memeories are more powerful than some may think. The Raven Queen, she teaches me that everything can hold a memory not just the mind. Be it these statues, the liliys, or even that necklace.\" She looks out across the water \"You are holding on to them so tightly but they are with you. Don't forget to grab onto those who need you as much as you need them.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:24:40.912000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740002232950456430","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"the Raven Queen..... goddess of death?\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:25:32.483000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740002449254908004","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"That is what she is known for... but she also preserves life and she has a fondness for memories.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:26:33.395000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740002704738484236","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"pulls out an emblem \"I follow The Lady of the Sea... though, I believe its one face of many gods..... We separate gods... rename them..... I have faith in life... many people thinks that means you have to protect life.... but death is a part of life too.... a balance.... same beliefs... differant face\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:28:39.942000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740003235514941483","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"(btw, we are standing near Amara and Navar's statues)","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:29:40.032000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740003487550537738","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"The gods may work together but they have their own goal. I don't see them as different faces, but as more of a community themselves trying to guide us.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:31:06.777000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740003851385700422","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"shakes his head \"What is the differance between a god of death that also embraces life... and a god of life that understands death?\" pulls out a gold coin at random and holds it up without looking \"two faces\" flips it over \n```Sandigill for mayor```","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:33:19.524000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740004408166842478","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"looks really embarrassed","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:33:49.015000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740004531861192764","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"We are called on different paths. We understand the same things in different ways. Neither is wrong if we can coexist.\" She smiles when the coin speaks","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:34:51.351000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740004793317326988","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"But I must take my leave. Sandigill it was a pleasure speaking with you, thank you for sharing your friends with me, and for discussing the philosophys of this place and of our gods.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T00:36:24.920000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740005185773895780","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
