{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"smiles and pauses a moment to really take in the view then says \"if i may ask.... now that you are here.... what is your hopes and dreams for this life?\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T01:32:24.329000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740019276156764252","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"\"I can honestly say I dont know. I was just planning on helping amara with whatever she was doing. Thats how it has always been. Like I have done stuff on my own but thats nothing I want to be doing here.\"","created_at":"2020-08-04T01:41:41.948000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740021614980104244","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"739055141759615027","content":"looks at Ophelia and thinks for a moment","created_at":"2020-08-04T01:44:34.992000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740022340779507804","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
